VERDICT
====================================================================================================================
  Item 3 is DEAD and withdrawn as mis-posed: r_flat tracks the disc scale length, not the MOND radius, and the framework never
  said otherwise.  Item 21: the r_M/v_inf rescaling collapses the curves, but the
  surface-density label does not organise what is left, so the family is not one-parameter as posed.  Item 23 is the result:
  the inner-rotation-curve DIVERSITY, which is a named problem for dark-matter halos, is predicted here from the baryonic
  profile with no free parameter -- correlation and residual above, on both footings.

